@@ -0,0 +1,9 @@
+---
+features:
+  - |
+    Added an ``enabled`` parameter (default ``True``) to ``Retrying``,
+    ``AsyncRetrying`` and the ``@retry`` decorator. With ``enabled=False`` the
+    decorated function is called directly, exactly once, with no retry logic,
+    and any exception it raises propagates unchanged. Iterating a disabled
+    ``Retrying`` or ``AsyncRetrying`` yields a single attempt whose exceptions
+    also propagate. This is useful during development and testing.
